<title>JAPAN: Excessive weakening of yen unlikely - MOF Mitsuzuka.</title>
<headline>Excessive weakening of yen unlikely - MOF Mitsuzuka.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>An excessive weakening of the yen is unlikely in the face of cooperation by the Group of Seven (G7) nations, Japan's Finance Minister Hiroshi Mitsuzuka told a parliamentary committee on Monday.</p>
</text>
